            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "Why aren't we going to Minos?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "I'm... I'm still not sure I can trust you any more than those mercenaries... What makes you different?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "The difference is that you are alive."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "You already have our next steps figured out, don't you...? What are we doing now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "We'll look for someone trustworthy to take us out of Ibut. Not legally, of course."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "Where are we going after that? Leithanien? Bol\u00edvar?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Before I give you an answer, you must understand that, whatever your choice, it doesn't change the fact you are running away from your problems."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You have no way to survive, nowhere to go, and nowhere to run."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Are you prepared to accept the fact that your old life has already shattered to pieces? Do you understand it? Are you sure you are not just in a daze from this sudden turn of events?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#8",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "Stop acting so high and mighty..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#8",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "If anger gives you a clearer head."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I will be going further north. Far away enough for you to leave everything in Columbia and Sargon behind."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I have to say. You've done very well."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#8",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "Are you mocking me...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#8",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Much of what you do is rife with immaturity, and you let your emotions get the better of you. If you were a little older, I would indeed make a mockery of you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Let's go. We need to find someone to introduce us to the black market here."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "Where do we find someone like that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I don't know yet..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "Hmph, so there's stuff you don't know?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I won't deny it, but we'll find them very soon."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "If you understand what 'The Land of Reefsteep' means and stands for, you won't have any trouble finding their survivors in the crowds and markets here. They will always help their fellow countrymen. All we have to do is make them believe that's who we are."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_171_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "Uh... What's that you're holding... Sargon coins?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "What can you even do with a few coins...?"
