    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "Being superstitious this time...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "Ah... How rare... It has been a long time since an outsider paid Old Isin a visit."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "Do you wish to take a peek at what destiny has laid out before you, or perhaps you are searching for a particular piece of gravel in this sandstorm?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "Am I correct to assume you are responsible for the ruckus earlier?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "Old Isin can tell, dear traveler. You are in a hurry, and trouble follows in your footsteps... Old Isin simply hopes this won't lead to any more trouble for Sargon..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "You are not from Sargon, no, but you carry a great burden..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "What is he mumbling to himself about...? Let's not waste any more time on him, Kal'tsit. They'll catch up!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
