    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sargon Villager",
        "text": "(Sargonian) You fraud! What are you still doing here?! Scram!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_072"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sargon Villager",
        "text": "(Sargonian) You're mucking up our turf! Enough with your tricks! No one here's going to fall for that!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "(Sargonian) Oh, right, of course. Don't be so violent now... Old Isin will leave. Old Isin is leaving."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "(Sargonian) Is your master doing well? Has she taken Old Isin's advice and pulled out of that deal yet? It will mean nothing but trouble for her."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_073",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sargon Villager",
        "text": "(Sargonian) My master? The chief would never listen to you jabbering types in the first place. If any lunatic in town could just waltz in and tell us how to do business, we might as well set up a suggestion box!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173",
            "name2": "avg_npc_072",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sargon Villager",
        "text": "(Sargonian) Enough chit-chat! Get out of here!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173"
        }
    },
