    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "The sun has set long ago, traveler. You are in a hurry, and there are dangers abound. Why waste your time here with Old Isin?"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "(Sargonian) As time goes by, even the greatest Padishah will one day be lost to the sands. His achievements will at that point crumble, and his subjects will scatter across the lands."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "(Sargonian) From the way you are dressed, you don't seem to be Sargonian. Is this perhaps the beginning to a narrative poem? Old Isin is far too old. Old Isin has long forgotten the appeal of poetry."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "(Sargonian) But his servants remain ever dedicated to their duties. They guard the unpopulated desert until a new civilization is ready to stand atop its sands, until the time a new Padishah arrives with the will of Sargon to rebuild those lands."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "(Sargonian) Ah, similar stories happen in all countries in the world time and again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "Catastrophes, diseases, war... There are a great many ways a city can meet its end... and to find itself conquered by a new, spirited ruler, thereby repeating the cycle once again."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_171_1#8"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "(What are they saying... Is this how Sargonian sounds?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "(Sargonian) 150 years ago, before these golden sands were named Ibut, there stood a magnificent city here. Do you remember anything of it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "(Sargonian) Of course... Old Isin remembers. The city that disappeared in those great winds."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "(Sargonian) The Padishah at the time gave these lands brimming with sand a name that might seem unfitting for a place in Sargon."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "...Reefsteep..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "(Sargonian) The only thing that remains of it is its name, passed down from one generation to the next, with none of them ever laying their eyes on its lush oases."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "(Sargonian) Are you its gatekeeper, then?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "Is there anything Old Isin can do for you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "We want to escape Sargon, leaving no tracks."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "Ah... Old Isin understands. Whose attention are you trying to avoid?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Not even Padishah can know of our whereabouts."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "Who are you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Please call me Kal'tsit."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "Kal'tsit... Lady Kal'tsit... As Old Isin gazed upon the sunrise this morning, Old Isin slipped back into my dreams in a trance. In Old Isin's dreams, Old Isin was told there would be a visitor who would revel in these secrets of antiquity with us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "You came early. The price is a single gold coin, my fair lady."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You deserve it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_171_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Elliot",
        "text": "(Just that much...?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "No, no... Not yet. Please hold on to it, my lady."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "This is a price that you will pay\u201422 years later. Remember this promise well, for it is worth far more than this gold coin."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "(Sargonian) You have lived in Sargon in its current form for the past hundred years. I suppose... not a single moment has gone by where you didn't look back and reminisce your homeland."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kaltsn07_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_173",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "(Sargonian) You are correct, my lady, but today is different."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_173"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mysterious Fortune Teller",
        "text": "(Stranger Sargonian) You opened the door for us."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
